  <NAME>Mus musculus</NAME>
  <TITLE>Transcriptome analysis of tumor-specific CD8 T cells in murine solid tumors</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>RNAseq analysis of CD8 T cells becoming dysfunctional in progressing tumors. The overall goal of this study was to elucidate the molecular program that mediates functional unresponsiveness in tumor-specific CD8 T cells. In comparison, we also investigated CD8 T cells differentiating to functional effector and memory T cells during an acute listeria infection. Overall design: T cells were sorted by flow cytometry and RNA-seq was performed.</DESCRIPTION>
